      "review_summary": "The PR hardens DigitalOcean, Linode, Scaleway, and Vultr direct-provider inventory, resolve, status-wait, reclaim, stop, cleanup, docs, and tests around canonical lease IDs and exact local provider/resource claims.\n\nReproducibility: yes. The underlying issue is source-reproducible on current main, and the remaining Vultr cleanup gap is visible from `ensureCleanupClaim` accepting key-only recovery states before `deleteServer` can call `DeleteInstance`; live cloud reproduction was not run in this read-only review.",
